# Ignore Rust/Cargo build artifacts
**/target/
**/debug/
**/release/

# Node modules and build output
**/node_modules/
**/build/
**/dist/

# IDE/editor
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS files
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Logs and temporary files
*.log
*.tmp

# Binaries and debug symbols
*.exe
*.pdb
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Lock files (keep if you intentionally commit them)
# package-lock.json
# yarn.lock
